c optimize nofile target zen4 assume n 0 31
```c
unsigned shl_assume(unsigned x,unsigned n){return x<<n;}
unsigned shl_guard(unsigned x,unsigned n){return n<32?x<<n:0;}
unsigned shr_guard(unsigned x,unsigned n){return n<32?x>>n:0;}
```
c optimize nofile assume a 1 1000
```c
int divb(int a){return 100/a;}
int mulb(int a){return a*100;}
```
